WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:13.198
Oh, what time is it?

2
00:00:13.199 --> 00:00:17.125
Is Nancy up already?

3
00:00:17.126 --> 00:00:22.927
No, she isn't.

4
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:26.368
"Woof! Woof! Nancy! Nancy!

5
00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:28.416
Time to get up!"

6
00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:32.035
"Okay! Okay! I am getting up."

7
00:00:32.036 --> 00:00:37.683
Every morning, I must wake her up.

8
00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:42.492
It is fun to watch Nancy brush her teeth.

9
00:00:42.493 --> 00:00:46.119
"Woof! Woof! Time to get dressed!"

10
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.206
Nancy puts on a skirt.

11
00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:54.107
Nancy pulls on socks too.

12
00:00:54.108 --> 00:00:57.115
"Muffy! Where is my schoolbag?"

13
00:00:57.116 --> 00:00:59.139
"What?"

14
00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:01.601
Nancy looks in her closet.

15
00:01:01.602 --> 00:01:03.876
I look under the desk.

16
00:01:03.877 --> 00:01:08.858
I find her bag under the desk. "Woof! Woof!"

17
00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:12.334
"Woof! Woof! Time to eat now!"

18
00:01:12.335 --> 00:01:14.950
Nancy eats a piece of toast.

19
00:01:14.951 --> 00:01:18.601
I eat my breakfast too.

20
00:01:18.602 --> 00:01:23.431
"Hurry! Here comes the school bus! Woof! Woof!"

21
00:01:23.432 --> 00:01:25.947
"Woof! Woof! Nancy!

22
00:01:25.948 --> 00:01:28.280
Don't forget your cap!"

23
00:01:28.281 --> 00:01:33.122
Whew! She always forgets something!

24
00:01:33.123 --> 00:01:37.601
But my job is not done yet.

25
00:01:37.602 --> 00:01:41.440
I must clean up her mess.

26
00:01:41.441 --> 00:01:45.751
Hmm. But I am a bit sleepy now.

27
00:01:45.752 --> 00:01:47.638
I will take a nap.

28
00:01:47.639 --> 00:01:54.027
I need to rest until Nancy comes back!
